{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a Futsal team, find new talents and become the best Futsal Manager in the world. Proudly Open Source: you can use, study, share and improve the source code.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >99Managers will be a series of sports management games for different team sports. It is open source and also respects your privacy, because it has no trackers or similar privacy-invading software integrated. Being open source means, that you can see the source code of the game and see how it is made. Besides that, you are also able to suggest bug fixes, new features or create your own customized version of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made with Godot Engine 4 and much love.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3334770?t=1773240315","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3334770?t=1773240315","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334770/ff06f5c143b0995b2a685bd948aa9bc648203adc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773240315","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334770/ff06f5c143b0995b2a685bd948aa9bc648203adc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773240315","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a Futsal team, find new talents and become the best Futsal Manager in the world. Proudly Open Source: you can use, study, share and improve the source code.</p><p class=\"bb_p